Why grid[nr][cn] = 2 Is Important

This line is extremely important:

grid[nr][cn] = 2;

Suppose two rotten oranges can reach the same fresh orange.

Without marking it immediately:

Rotten A → fresh
Rotten B → same fresh

the same cell could be inserted into the queue multiple times.

By doing:

grid[nr][cn] = 2;

as soon as we enqueue it:

fresh
